The three-layer design (property source meta-annotation, property source
extension loader template, configuration change events) is inspired by
microsphere-configuration and microsphere-spring. This product is an
independent rewrite: it fixes the Nacos annotation spelling issue, redesigns
the change event model around property-level old/new values, adds a generic
Spring Cloud EnvironmentChangeEvent adapter, and ships a rewritten test suite.
